  "content": "\n\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"display:table\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Vs9AVkxjYY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZEORx0F.png\" width=\"225\" height=\"75\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shedaniel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LrVLC2a.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"75\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252ftranslate%252froughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2X5V8hc.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"75\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/shedaniel_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3cRJyIY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"201\" height=\"75\"></a><br></span></p>\n<p><strong>在 Forge 上您需要 REIPC：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items-hacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/shedaniel_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p>\n<p><em>乾淨且可自訂。輕鬆瀏覽配方的方式。</em></p>\n<p>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a>。</p>\n<p>下載檔包含 Forge 與 Fabric 的檔案！請下載正確的版本！</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.21.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.21.2 至 1.21.3 (REI 17)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.21.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.21 至 1.21.1 (REI 16)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.20.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.20.5 至 1.20.6 (REI 15)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.20.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.20.4 (REI 14)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.20.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.20.2 (REI 13)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.20\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.20 至 1.20.1 (REI 12)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.19.4 (REI 11)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.19.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.19.3 (REI 10)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.19\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.19 至 1.19.2 (REI 9)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.18.2 (REI 8)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.18.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.18 至 1.18.1 (REI 7)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.17 至 1.17.1 (REI 6)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.16.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.16.4 至 1.16.5 (REI 5/6)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.16.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.16.2 至 1.16.3 (REI 5)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.16.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.16 至 1.16.1 (REI 4)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.15.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.15 至 1.15.2 (REI 3)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.14.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.14 至 1.14.4 (REI 3)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.13.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.13.2 (REI 2)</a></h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items/files?version=1.13\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 1.13 (REI 2)</a></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TfttQKk.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">需要伺服器與朋友一起玩嗎？或是不知道如何架設？直接租用已經設定好的伺服器吧！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fshedaniel\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" alt=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" width=\"333\" height=\"108\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;點擊上方圖片，選擇方案（至少 4 GB），使用我的代碼&nbsp;<strong>shedaniel</strong>&nbsp;即可獲得首月&nbsp;<strong>25%</strong>&nbsp;折扣，盡情與朋友同樂！</p>\n<p><strong>配方匯出：</strong></p>\n<p>REI 提供一個預設未綁定的快捷鍵，可用於匯出配方，範例如下：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uG2NNLw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"132\"></p>\n<p><strong>JEI 外掛支援：（Forge）</strong></p>\n<p>此模組確實支援 JEI 外掛。部分模組可能需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items-hacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">REI 相容性解決方案</a>。</p>\n<p>如果您希望在伺服器上同時支援 JEI 和 REI 使用者，請在伺服器上安裝 JEI 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items-server-component\" rel=\"nofollow\">REI 伺服器元件</a>&nbsp;。</p>\n<p><strong>收藏 / 書籤：</strong></p>\n<p>將遊標懸停在任何物品上時按下 <strong>A</strong> 即可將其加入收藏。</p>\n<p><strong>進階搜尋：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><strong>搜尋模式</strong><br><strong>模組：</strong> <code>@modname</code>\n<p>不分大小寫，透過模組名稱搜尋，例如 <code>@materialisation</code> 搜尋 Materialisation 模組新增的物品。</p>\n<strong>提示文字：</strong> <code>#text</code>\n<p>不分大小寫，透過提示文字搜尋，例如 <code>#protection</code> 搜尋防護類書籍。</p>\n<strong>標籤：</strong> <code>$tag</code>\n<p>不分大小寫，透過標籤搜尋，例如 <code>$logs</code> 搜尋原木。</p>\n<strong>正則表達式：</strong> <code>r/regex/</code>\n<p>區分大小寫，透過正則表達式搜尋，例如 <code>r/(Golden )?Apple)</code> 搜尋金蘋果或蘋果。</p>\n<strong>引號：</strong>\n<p>允許包含空格，例如 <code>\"#protection iii\"</code> 進行帶有空格的搜尋。</p>\n<strong>或：</strong> <code>|</code>\n<p>表示「或」，例如 <code>apple|$logs</code> 搜尋蘋果或原木。</p>\n</div>\n<p><strong>版本路線圖：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4V9o02v.png\" width=\"1905\" height=\"521\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uvBmJsf.png\" width=\"1425\" height=\"390\"></p>\n<h4>REI 5</h4>\n<p>Fabric 1.16.x - 錯誤修復至 2022 年 2 月 28 日</p>\n<h4><br>REI 6</h4>\n<p>Forge 1.16.x - 功能更新至 2022 年 3 月（至少）</p>\n<p>Fabric 1.17.x&nbsp;- 功能更新至 2022 年 3 月（至少）</p>\n<p>Forge 1.17.x&nbsp;- 功能更新至 2022 年 3 月（至少）</p>\n<h4>REI 7</h4>\n<p>Fabric 1.18.x&nbsp;- 功能更新至 1.19（至少）</p>\n<p>Forge 1.18.x&nbsp;- 功能更新至 1.19（至少）</p>\n<p>協助完成此問卷調查以支持 REI，您的每一份回覆都將受到感謝。</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSddhg6CdI9isLb2OpmDGQZwWgMUYk9RjwtAfDrs-ISeJuYZMg/viewform?embedded=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\">載入中…</iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>請勿在留言區詢問支援問題，相關支援請至 Discord 伺服器！</strong></p>",
